"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/melee.svg","name":"Spewed Rock","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"value":["reload-1","thrown-30"],"otherTags":[]},"damageRolls":{"dRfM6CLtotuxatXe":{"damage":"2d12+10","damageType":"bludgeoning","category":null}},"bonus":{"value":18},"attackEffects":{"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"_migration":{"version":0.932,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}}},"effects":[],"_id":"5FKY9mcYiyIPcZn0","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688327430228,"modifiedTime":1688327473140,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Churn","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per round</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The groundgullet churns its insides, damaging the creatures within. Creatures Swallowed inside the groundgullet take [[/r (2d8+6)[bludgeoning]]] damage, with a @Check[type:reflex|dc:26|basic:true] save. Creatures that fail this save also fall if they were attempting to @Compendium[pf2e.actionspf2e.pprgrYQ1QnIDGZiy]{Climb} out.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["attack"]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"action"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":1},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""},"frequency":{"max":1,"per":"round"}},"effects":[],"_id":"YmPhFRUuGVdEV9ll","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688327475253,"modifiedTime":1688327527244,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Cover Pit","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The groundgullet closes a thick membrane above its opening, which immediately matches the appearance of the surrounding terrain. It gains standard cover and attempts to Hide. If a Small or Medium creature moves into the groundgullet's space, it can use Swallow as normal. Otherwise, its cover can support up to 2 Bulk of unattended objects. Creatures with the Trap Finder feat or similar abilities gain the benefits against a groundgullet using Cover Pit.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"action"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":3},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"EOCthH8w9dSFeA4j","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688327533149,"modifiedTime":1688327583555,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Decomposing Belch","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>All creatures within a @Template[type:emanation|distance:30] must attempt a @Check[type:fortitude|dc:24] save. Creatures adjacent to or sharing the groundgullet's space take a -2 circumstance penalty to this check.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected and is temporarily immune for 1 hour.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature is @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Sickened]{Sickened 1}.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature is @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Sickened]{Sickened 2}.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"action"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":2},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"M3dcgU0PqQAijj3k","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688327533762,"modifiedTime":1688327679891,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Shifting Earth","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>A groundgullet's body is a 15-foot deep pit. It can Burrow through earthen material such that its opening remains on the surface. When it does, it visibly disturbs the earth along its path, turning it into difficult terrain. It can instead choose to Burrow at half Speed and leave no trail. A groundgullet can move through other creatures' spaces, and it can share the space of other Medium or smaller creatures.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"yLjZjEXxCjmIqvLa","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688327689007,"modifiedTime":1688327711835,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Spray","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The groundgullet sprays churned rock and stomach acid. It deals @Damage[2d6[bludgeoning],2d6[acid]]{2d6 bludgeoning damage and 2d6 acid} damage to creatures in a @Template[type:cone|distance:20], with a @Check[type:reflex|dc:24|basic:true] save.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"action"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":2},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"BLc6BaPRyIdNk82m","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.3.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688327715467,"modifiedTime":1691261013669,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Swallow","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per round</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The groundgullet doesn't contain a creature inside it</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> The groundgullet enters another creature's space or another creature enters the groundgullet's space</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The creature falls into the groundgullet. It can attempt to @Compendium[pf2e.actionspf2e.Grab an Edge]{Grab an Edge} (@Check[type:reflex|dc:26] save); on a critical success, the creature can Step as part of the reaction, and if it does and leaves the groundgullet's space it doesn't fall. Creatures inside the groundgullet are forced to move along with it, and at the beginning of their turn they take [[/r (3d6+8)[acid]]] damage (@Check[type:fortitude|dc:24|basic:true] save) and are affected by Decomposing Belch. The groundgullet loses the cover granted by its Cover Pit ability when taking this action. While it has a creature swallowed, a groundgullet's opening must remain on the surface as it Burrows. A creature can Climb out of the groundgullet with a successful @Check[type:athletics|dc:26] check, which they can reduce using rope or other tools; if they have a way to reach to the top of the 15-foot pit, they can simply pull themselves out with a single action, which has the move trait.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"free"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"l9jGgIgv19dXrZUn","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688327717562,"modifiedTime":1688327804860,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}],"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"6.1.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1685401626117,"modifiedTime":1736542897032,"lastModifiedBy":"l2rbNx2a8f5ocpeL","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"cp1mq24Yt1lnjpdU","folder":"rnSyamM9GQTIpuOo","ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"sort":4800000}